          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Connect</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Contact {{THERAPIST_NAME}} for confidential, trauma-informed therapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Schedule a consultation or ask a question.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#0f0f10;--card:#0f1720;--muted:#9aa4aa;--accent:#b889ff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);--max:1100px}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,\\\"Helvetica Neue\\\",Arial;color:#e6eef6;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071017 0%, #071623 60%);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    header{max-width:var(--max);margin:32px auto;padding:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\\n    .logo{width:64px;height:64px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1b2630,#0b1220);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(11,16,26,0.6)}\\n    .logo svg{width:44px;height:44px}\\n    .titles h1{font-size:18px;margin:0;color:#fff;letter-spacing:0.2px}\\n    .titles p{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    nav{margin-left:auto}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}\\n    nav a:hover{color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}\\n\\n    .hero{max-width:var(--max);margin:20px auto 36px;padding:28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:16px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:28px;align-items:stretch}\\n    .hero-left{padding:20px}\\n    .kicker{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(184,137,255,0.14),rgba(120,130,255,0.06));color:var(--accent);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:13px}\\n    .hero-left h2{margin:16px 0 8px;font-size:28px;color:#fff}\\n    .hero-left p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}\\n    .hero-cta{margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#071017;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}\\n    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(184,137,255,0.14)}\\n\\n    .hero-right{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border-radius:12px;padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .contact-card{background:var(--glass);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .avatar{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#291029,#0f1b2a)}\\n    .avatar svg{width:56px;height:56px}\\n    .contact-meta{flex:1}\\n    .contact-meta strong{color:#fff;display:block}\\n    .contact-meta small{color:var(--muted)}\\n    .contact-links{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}\\n    .pill{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;text-decoration:none}\\n\\n    .grid{max-width:var(--max);margin:26px auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:26px;padding:0 10px}\\n    .panel{background:#07101a;padding:22px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}\\n    .panel h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#fff}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}\\n\\n    .checklist{display:grid;gap:10px}\\n    .check{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .check svg{flex:0 0 36px}\\n    .plan{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#08111a,#051018);padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n\\n    form label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}\\n    form input,form textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:#e8f1f8}\\n    form textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}\\n    .legal{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}\\n\\n    footer{max-width:var(--max);margin:34px auto;padding:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}\\n    .disclaimer{font-size:12px;color:#9aa4aa;line-height:1.5;margin-top:12px}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:900px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:18px}\\n      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      header{padding:12px}\\n      nav{display:none}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <!-- assets/img/hero.svg (inlined for portability) -->\\n        <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n              <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#b889ff\\\"/>\\n              <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#7b83ff\\\"/>\\n            </linearGradient>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect x=\\\"6\\\" y=\\\"6\\\" width=\\\"52\\\" height=\\\"52\\\" rx=\\\"10\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n          <path d=\\\"M20 40c6-8 20-8 26 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#b889ff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2.5\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n          <circle cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"24\\\" r=\\\"8\\\" stroke=\\\"#7b83ff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2.5\\\"/>\\n        </svg>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"titles\\\">\\n        <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n        <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Welcome</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">My Story</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Focus Areas</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">How I Work</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Investment</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"faq.html\\\">Questions</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <section class=\\\"hero\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-hero\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"hero-left\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"kicker\\\">Private Practice • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</span>\\n      <h2 id=\\\"contact-hero\\\">Find a gentle way in — reach out when you’re ready</h2>\\n      <p>I'm {{THERAPIST_NAME}}, a {{LICENSE}} offering confidential, evidence-informed therapy for anxiety, trauma, relationships, life transitions and burnout. If you’re considering therapy, the first step can be a small message. Please include what brings you here and a good time to talk.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-cta\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Email Me</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Accepting referrals and new clients. Telehealth and in-person sessions available where appropriate.</p>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <aside class=\\\"hero-right\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"contact-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"avatar\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <!-- assets/img/avatar.svg (inlined) -->\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n            <rect width=\\\"64\\\" height=\\\"64\\\" rx=\\\"10\\\" fill=\\\"url(#a1)\\\"/>\\n            <defs>\\n              <linearGradient id=\\\"a1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#34203a\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#0b1726\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n            </defs>\\n            <g fill=\\\"#e9f1fb\\\" opacity=\\\"0.92\\\">\\n              <circle cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"22\\\" r=\\\"9\\\"/>\\n              <path d=\\\"M14 50c3-8 19-8 18-8s15 0 18 8v4H14v-4z\\\"/>\\n            </g>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"contact-meta\\\">\\n          <strong>{{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}}</strong>\\n          <small class=\\\"muted\\\">Private Practice | {{MODALITIES}}</small>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"contact-links\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"pill\\\" href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">Call: {{PHONE}}</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"pill\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Email: {{EMAIL}}</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"pill\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Request a session</a>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"plan\\\">\\n        <strong style=\\\"display:block;color:#fff\\\">Quick availability snapshot</strong>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0\\\">Typical openings: weekday mornings and alternating late afternoons. Please include your timezone when you write.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n    <section class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n      <h3>Short diagnostic — a few prompts to include</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">If you’d like me to better prioritize your message, consider answering any that feel relevant:</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"checklist\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"check\\\">\\n          <svg width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"11\\\" stroke=\\\"#2f3750\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7.5 12.5l2.5 2.5 6-7\\\" stroke=\\\"#b889ff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/></svg>\\n          <div>\\n            <strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Current concern</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">What brought you here? Brief description (1–3 sentences) is fine.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"check\\\">\\n          <svg width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><rect x=\\\"2\\\" y=\\\"2\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" rx=\\\"5\\\" stroke=\\\"#2f3750\\\"/><path d=\\\"M8 12h8\\\" stroke=\\\"#7b83ff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/></svg>\\n          <div>\\n            <strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">History & supports</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Any previous therapy, current supports, or medication you think I should know.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"check\\\">\\n          <svg width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><path d=\\\"M12 2v20\\\" stroke=\\\"#2f3750\\\"/><path d=\\\"M4 8h16\\\" stroke=\\\"#b889ff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/></svg>\\n          <div>\\n            <strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Goals</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">What would a helpful next 3 months look like for you?</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#fff\\\">First plan — what happens after you write</h4>\\n        <ol class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"padding-left:18px;margin:0;line-height:1.6\\\">\\n          <li>I review your message and suggest next steps within 48 business hours.</li>\\n          <li>We schedule an intake or a brief consult to see fit and availability.</li>\\n          <li>We set a rhythm: weekly, biweekly, or short-term check-ins depending on needs.</li>\\n        </ol>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#fff\\\">Micro practices you can try</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Small, daily practices that often ease early distress: a 3-minute grounding breath when feeling overwhelmed, a single realistic boundary to test with a trusted person, and a short evening reflection about one thing that felt tolerable today.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:10px\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Request an intake</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" href=\\\"#contact-form\\\">Send a message</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <aside class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n      <h3>Contact form</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Use the form below for a confidential message. I respond within 48 business hours. If you are in crisis, please see the note below before submitting.</p>\\n\\n      <form id=\\\"contact-form\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name (or initials)</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"e.g., Jordan\\\" required>\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"email\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Email</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"row\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone (optional)</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\">\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <label for=\\\"pref\\\">Preferred contact</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"pref\\\" name=\\\"pref\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email, Phone, Secure portal\\\">\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"message\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Brief message</label>\\n        <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"A short description of what you hope to address\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">Send message</button>\\n          <a class=\\\"pill\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Or email directly</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"legal\\\">\\n          By submitting you consent to a response from {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. Messages are treated as confidential and stored according to professional recordkeeping, except where disclosure is required by law. For urgent or emergent situations, call local emergency services or your nearest crisis line immediately.\\n        </div>\\n      </form>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#fff\\\">A brief pricing note</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Standard session formats: 50–55 minute therapy sessions; sliding-fee options available by request. See full details on the <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Investment</a> page.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#fff\\\">Boundaries & scope</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:0\\\">I am a licensed clinician providing psychotherapy and coaching within scope of training. I do not provide legal, medical, or forensic services. If care outside my scope is needed, I will discuss referrals.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n    </aside>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"disclaimer\\\">Confidentiality is a priority; communications through email may not be fully secure. Crisis disclaimer: This site is not a crisis service. If you are thinking about harming yourself or others, please contact local emergency services or your regional crisis hotline immediately.</div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <!-- subtle decorative pattern (assets/img/pattern.svg inlined) -->\\n  <svg width=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <defs>\\n      <pattern id=\\\"p1\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\" patternTransform=\\\"rotate(12)\\\">\\n        <rect width=\\\"12\\\" height=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"rgba(184,137,255,0.02)\\\"/>\\n        <rect x=\\\"12\\\" y=\\\"12\\\" width=\\\"12\\\" height=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"rgba(120,130,255,0.02)\\\"/>\\n      </pattern>\\n    </defs>\\n  </svg>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# private_practice_therapist — Contact chunk\\n\\nThis bundle contains the contact page and a short README for the lux_gallery layout of the private practice therapist website.\\n\\nFiles included:\\n- contact.html — the complete contact page, responsive and self-contained. Inline SVGs are used for imagery (hero, avatar, pattern) so no external assets are required.\\n\\nPlaceholders used (replace as part of build/deploy):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{THERAPIST_NAME}}\\n- {{LICENSE}}\\n- {{MODALITIES}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n\\nDesign notes:\\n- Layout family: lux_gallery — large hero, restrained color palette, inlined vector art for gallery-style emphasis.\\n- The contact page intentionally \\\"ripples\\\" the required section pack by including small versions of: diagnostic (\\\"Short diagnostic — a few prompts\\\"), plan (\\\"First plan — what happens after you write\\\"), micro_habits (\\\"Micro practices you can try\\\"), pricing snapshot (brief note linking to Investment/fees), and clear CTAs (primary CTA button and form submission). This ensures the contact page echoes the index-level sections and provides consistent navigation for prospective clients.\\n\\nClinical / ethical content included:\\n- Confidentiality/privacy note in the form and footer.\\n- Crisis disclaimer telling users to contact emergency services or crisis hotlines.\\n- Scope & boundaries statement describing limits of practice and referral approach.\\n\\nNavigation labels intentionally vary from other templates (e.g., \\\"My Story\\\" instead of \\\"About\\\", \\\"Focus Areas\\\" instead of \\\"Specialties\\\", \\\"Schedule\\\" instead of \\\"Book\\\") to satisfy uniqueness rules while keeping links correct.\\n\\nHow to use:\\n- Replace placeholders with real values.\\n- Drop contact.html into the site root alongside the other templates (index.html, about.html, specialties.html, approach.html, fees.html, faq.html, book.html). Links in the nav expect those filenames.\\n- The contact form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} — adjust to your form-handling endpoint or integrate with your backend.\\n\\nAccessibility & responsiveness:\\n- Responsive grid adapts to smaller screens; nav collapses for narrow viewports.\\n- Semantic HTML and clear labels included for form fields.\\n\\nIf you need additional chunks (other pages, separate asset files for the SVGs, or localization), request the next chunk and specify assets or build preferences.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
